    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>YOU MAY BE INTERESTED</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489370/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.poster.avif?t=1753091406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489370/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.webm?t=1753091406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489370/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.mp4?t=1753091406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>What is this game about?</strong><br>You are the owner of a internet cafe, visitors come to you every day who are eager to play various computer games. Your goal is to develop in order to meet their needs as much as possible, and at the same time make a profit from it<br><br><strong>What am I going to do?</strong><br>It's just like in real life, only you work in a internet cafe. Accordingly, your actions are to buy equipment, food, clean up and equip your cafe<br><br><strong>What is special about this game and how does it differ from other games of this genre?</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game has many elements of real life (hunger, thirst, urine, mood, freedom of action, etc.)<br></li><li>The ability to assemble a PC from components<br></li><li>A smartphone with many applications and functions (Camera, Wallet, Calendar, Calls, Notes, etc.)<br></li><li>Ibay online auction, where you can sell and buy things<br></li><li>Incredibly smart AI that won't make you bored<br></li><li>Realistic car (realistic physics, fuel, oil, coolant, engine overheating, light, battery)<br></li><li>Realistic environment that will allow you to fully immerse yourself in the game world</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489370/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.poster.avif?t=1753091406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489370/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.webm?t=1753091406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489370/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.mp4?t=1753091406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>What is this game about?</strong><br>You are the owner of a internet cafe, visitors come to you every day who are eager to play various computer games. Your goal is to develop in order to meet their needs as much as possible, and at the same time make a profit from it<br><br><strong>What am I going to do?</strong><br>It's just like in real life, only you work in a internet cafe. Accordingly, your actions are to buy equipment, food, clean up and equip your cafe<br><br><strong>What is special about this game and how does it differ from other games of this genre?</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game has many elements of real life (hunger, thirst, urine, mood, freedom of action, etc.)<br></li><li>The ability to assemble a PC from components<br></li><li>A smartphone with many applications and functions (Camera, Wallet, Calendar, Calls, Notes, etc.)<br></li><li>Ibay online auction, where you can sell and buy things<br></li><li>Incredibly smart AI that won't make you bored<br></li><li>Realistic car (realistic physics, fuel, oil, coolant, engine overheating, light, battery)<br></li><li>Realistic environment that will allow you to fully immerse yourself in the game world</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Build and manage your own internet caf\u00e9, starting with second-hand computers and growing into a local hotspot for gamers and students. Balance your budget, upgrade your gear, and outsmart competitors to become the king of the neighborhood",
